{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnySolidFormApi = AnyFormApi & SolidTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L52","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:52"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Solid form API whose form data and error types are erased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable Solid components that only need core form operations and\nthe "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Field"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayField"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Subscribe"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormGroup"},{"type":"text","value":" components common to\nevery Solid form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SolidFormType"},{"type":"text","value":" when a component depends on one known form."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function FormSubmitButton(props: { form: AnySolidFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting()}>\n          {isSubmitting() ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </props.form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnySolidFormApi = AnyFormApi & SolidTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L52)\n\nA Solid form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Solid components that only need core form operations and\nthe `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common to\nevery Solid form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use `SolidFormType` when a component depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction FormSubmitButton(props: { form: AnySolidFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting()}>\n          {isSubmitting() ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </props.form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnySolidFormApi\ntitle: AnySolidFormApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnySolidFormApi = AnyFormApi & SolidTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts:52](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/solid-form/src/formApiTypes.public.ts#L52)\n\nA Solid form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Solid components that only need core form operations and\nthe `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common to\nevery Solid form. Field paths and values are not checked against a particular\nform shape; use `SolidFormType` when a component depends on one known form.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction FormSubmitButton(props: { form: AnySolidFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <props.form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting()}>\n          {isSubmitting() ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </props.form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
